  "description": "Big wheel freestylin'. The DMC 29\" takes its design cues from the early Haro timeline and the pure freestyle fortitude of Dennic \"DMC\" McCoy. Twin top tube Master frame configuration, constructed of heat-treated aluminum for the ultimate ratio of high strength, low weight. Chromoly fork, 7\" rise chromoly Freestyler bars, high-flanged sealed bearing hubs, double-wall alloy rims and a custom DMC seat for cruising in comfort on one wheel or two...\n6061-T6 heat-treated aluminum frame w/integrated head tube, mid BB, V-brake mounts.\n100% chromoly fork with internally threaded 1-piece CNC steer tube, tapered legs\nHaro Baseline 3-pc chromoly 175mm crank. 36T alloy chainring\nPoly Platform pedals, chromoly 9/16\" Axle\nHaro Freestyler chromoly 7\" rise bars\n36 hole double wall alloy rims with high flange sealed hubs\nHaro DMC railed seat\nHaro Lineage CNC stem. 52mm reach\nHaro Team Grips\nProMax V-brake and lever",
